<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 431 0 R
/E (Ongoing -- The Absence Alert From Day 1 forward, this system runs quietly in the background. Any member who misses five or more consecutive classes gets a personal outreach from their coach within 24 hours. Not a marketing email. A real message from a real person who noticed they were gone. This single touch prevents more cancellations than any re-engagement campaign you could ever run.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 431 0 R
/E (Week 8 -- The Progress Review Go back to your Week 4 notes. Compare where they are now to what they told you then. Have they moved toward their goal? Are they showing up consistently? If progress is real, name it out loud. If something has slipped, find out why before it becomes a problem. This conversation is where coaches catch the early signs of disengagement while there is still time to act.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 431 0 R
/E (Week 12 -- The Commitment Conversation This is the most important conversation in the entire system. Ask them where they want to be six months from now. Get specific. Write it down. Put a date on it. When a member has a clearly defined future goal that lives inside your box, walking away means abandoning that goal. You are not just retaining a member at this point. You are giving them a reason to stay that belongs entirely to them.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
702 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 431 0 R
