1008 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 445 0 R
/E (        Most gym owners think about growth as a math problem: more leads in, more members out. So they run ads, post on Instagram, and hope. But the most profitable boxes in the country have discovered something different -- their existing members are the most powerful growth engine they will ever have access to, and most owners are leaving it completely untouched.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1009 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 445 0 R
/E (       This is the Community Flywheel. It is the idea that when members feel recognized, connected, and genuinely proud of what happens inside your box, they do three things automatically: they stay longer, they bring people with them, and they become public advocates that no ad budget can replicate.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
