/P 446 0 R
/E (      A referred member costs $0 to acquire vs. $180-$400 per paid lead. Referred members retain 37% longer than cold-acquired members on average. Boxes with a structured recognition system see member NPS scores 2x higher than those)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1015 0 obj
<<
