/P 458 0 R
/E (         Everything in this playbook is real and executable. You do not need us to do it. Take the retention sequences from Lever 1, build them into your current gym software this week. Take the revenue stream launch guide from Lever 2 and run your first specialty program next month. Take the referral system from Lever 3 and activate it with a "Bring a Friend" push before the end of this quarter.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 458 0 R
/E (        It will work. It will just take longer than it needs to. You will run into implementation questions that cost you time you do not have. You will second-guess the copy on your emails. You will launch a program without the pricing structure dialed in and undercharge for it. You will build a referral system that gets ignored because the ask was not framed the right way.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 458 0 R
