/P 458 0 R
/E (We do not hand you templates and wish you luck. We build the systems with you -- the retention email and SMS sequences, the specialty program launch strategy, the referral engine, the community flywheel infrastructure -- and we manage and optimize them every month with your actual numbers in front of us.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 458 0 R
/E (           We track the revenue. We track the churn. We adjust based on what your specific market responds to. And because we only work with CrossFit boxes, we are not learning your world on your dime.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 458 0 R
/E (             Most marketing agencies will take your money, run your ads, and send you a report full of impressions and click-through rates while your actual member count stays flat. We do not work that way. Every recommendation we make is tied to one number: revenue in your bank account. If the system we built is not producing, we fix it -- because our reputation is built on CrossFit boxes that grow, not on retainer checks from owners who are too busy to notice nothing is changing.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [12]
>>
